1. Key & Credential Management
	•	What it means: Who controls the secrets (API keys, access tokens, encryption keys) that allow access to models?
	•	Controls available:
	•	Azure Key Vault / Databricks Secrets: Store all sensitive credentials.
	•	Customer-Managed Keys (CMK): Replace platform-managed keys with your own HSM-backed keys.
	•	Rotate & expire keys regularly.
	•	Impact: Prevents unauthorized access, ensures cryptographic control of data and models.

