3. Authentication & Identity Controls
	•	Azure Entra ID / Databricks OAuth: Federated identity to prevent local password management.
	•	Service Principals & Managed Identities: Machine-to-machine secure calls, avoiding static keys.
	•	Personal Access Tokens (PATs): Only for development; production should use service principals.
	•	RBAC (Role-Based Access Control): Define who can call the LLM, who can deploy models, and who can access logs.

