4. Network & Segmentation Controls
	•	Private Endpoints / VNet Integration: Ensure LLM traffic never traverses public internet.
	•	Subnet isolation: Dedicated subnets for LLM inference, separate from dev/test.
	•	Firewall rules & NSGs: Restrict inbound/outbound to approved IPs or services.
	•	Dedicated compute: Prevent “noisy neighbor” or multi-tenant risks.

