5. Governance & Data Controls
	•	Data residency & compliance: Ensure model and logs are stored only in allowed regions.
	•	Data classification & filtering: Tag sensitive data, block PII from being sent to LLMs.
	•	Prompt Injection Defense: Guardrails against malicious queries that try to exfiltrate data.
	•	Retention policies: Decide how long prompts, completions, and logs are retained.

