6. Monitoring & Audit Controls
	•	Audit logs: Who accessed which LLM, with what data, and what response.
	•	Observability: Latency, token usage, model drift, anomalous responses.
	•	Usage quotas & throttling: Control cost & abuse.
	•	Red teaming & testing: Validate against jailbreaks, prompt leaks, bias.

