7. Model Lifecycle & Deployment Controls
	•	Versioning: Always track which model version is in production.
	•	Approval workflows: Require approvals before new models or fine-tuned versions go live.
	•	Rollback capability: Revert quickly if a deployment misbehaves.
	•	Isolation: Separate dev, staging, and prod model endpoints.

