8. Content & Safety Controls (LLM-specific)
	•	Input validation: Strip malicious prompts before hitting the model.
	•	Output filtering: Use Azure AI Content Safety or custom rules to block toxic / harmful responses.
	•	Guardrails framework: Enforce policies on topics (e.g. “don’t answer financial advice”, “don’t output PII”).
	•	Rate limiting by user: Prevents abuse or cost blowouts.

