📌 In Short

Think of LLM control mechanisms across five layers:
	1.	Keys & Identity – Who can even talk to the model?
	2.	Encryption – Is all data (prompts, responses, logs) cryptographically safe?
	3.	Network – Can traffic flow only where it’s supposed to?
	4.	Governance – Are compliance, policies, and data rules enforced?
	5.	Runtime Safety – Are inputs/outputs monitored, filtered, and logged?
